{"unit_id":"mswinandmc__dsh-session-port#card-zh","repo":"mswinandmc/dsh-session-port","commit":"903cec21e9bd4ed8222b7abe443911c1cca69544","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-port 是 DSH Web 的会话导入导出插件。它在会话标题栏提供导出按钮，在侧栏提供导入面板，并注册 session_port 工具。用户可将会话及附件导出为 ZIP，也可从 ZIP 或 JSONL 导入并新建会话；导出还可包含子会话。导入会恢复附件、校正会话标记并回读检查。适合备份、迁移和恢复聊天记录。安装后即可使用，不需要额外账号或 API 密钥；可设置导入大小上限、附件选项、格式版本和导出目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:48-51","index.js:322-390","client.js:838-894","lib/host.js:226-320","lib/host.js:515-620"]}
{"unit_id":"mswinandmc__dsh-session-port#card-en","repo":"mswinandmc/dsh-session-port","commit":"903cec21e9bd4ed8222b7abe443911c1cca69544","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-port exports DSH conversations and imports them as new sessions. It adds a header button, sidebar panel, and agent tool. ZIP archives include attachments and child sessions; ZIP or JSONL imports restore attachments and verify the new session. No account or API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:48-51","index.js:322-390","client.js:838-894","lib/host.js:226-320","lib/host.js:515-620"]}
