{"unit_id":"mswinandmc__dsh-session-port#feature-1","repo":"mswinandmc/dsh-session-port","commit":"903cec21e9bd4ed8222b7abe443911c1cca69544","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-port 的功能「会话 ZIP 导出」：把当前会话日志及引用附件写入 ZIP，并可包含子会话。用户点击会话标题栏的导出按钮，或调用 session_port 工具导出当前会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:838-849","index.js:322-371","lib/host.js:287-318"]}
{"unit_id":"mswinandmc__dsh-session-port#feature-2","repo":"mswinandmc/dsh-session-port","commit":"903cec21e9bd4ed8222b7abe443911c1cca69544","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-port 的功能「导入会话」：从 ZIP 压缩包或 JSONL 日志读取会话，恢复附件并在当前工作区创建一条新会话；可从侧栏拖入文件或通过工具提供路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:880-894","index.js:373-385","lib/host.js:515-597"]}
{"unit_id":"mswinandmc__dsh-session-port#feature-3","repo":"mswinandmc/dsh-session-port","commit":"903cec21e9bd4ed8222b7abe443911c1cca69544","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-port 的功能「导入后校验」：写入导入事件后重新读取新会话，若当前 DSH 无法打开则返回告警，帮助用户及时发现格式不兼容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:596-620","lib/host.js:631-635"]}
{"unit_id":"mswinandmc__dsh-session-port#feature-4","repo":"mswinandmc/dsh-session-port","commit":"903cec21e9bd4ed8222b7abe443911c1cca69544","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-port 的功能「附件随行」：导入时将归档内的附件写入 DSH 附件存储，并把会话日志中的引用替换为新存储引用，便于在新会话中查看附件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:565-584"]}
{"unit_id":"mswinandmc__dsh-session-port#caveat-1","repo":"mswinandmc/dsh-session-port","commit":"903cec21e9bd4ed8222b7abe443911c1cca69544","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-port 使用前须知：导入会校验归档会话格式版本，版本与当前 DSH 不一致时会拒绝导入；JSONL 导出不包含附件和子会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:256-260","lib/host.js:532-540"]}
